  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Graal is a krogan weapon made for hunting thresher maws. It fires clusters of barbed spikes meant to lodge in a target far larger than the shooter and keep it bleeding. Against anything smaller than a maw the effect is excessive. A creature hit by the Graal also takes <strong>1d6 persistent bleed</strong> damage.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
